OL,3,AMistrial declared in Lindsay Clancy
OL,4,Amurder case, after jury deadlocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,8,Fattempted suicide
OL,10,FA Massachusetts judge has declared a
OL,11,Fmistrial in the murder case against
OL,12,FLindsay Clancy after jurors conceded
OL,13,Fthey would not be able to unanimously
OL,14,Fdecide whether she should be held
OL,15,Fcriminally liable for killing her three
OL,16,Fyoung children after a week of
OL,17,Fdeliberating.
OL,19,FThe case against Clancy has both
OL,20,Fcaptivated and heavily divided the
OL,21,FAmerican public, even spurring remarks
OL,22,Ffrom the US president.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
